        ],
        "description": "UK Act of Parliament reforming criminal justice, policing, and online offences; Section 248 inserts Section 216A into the Online Safety Act 2023 to bring standalone AI chatbots and AI-generated content providers within statutory online-safety regulation.",
        "notes": "Status: In force (Royal Assent April 2026; 2026 c. 20; verified as of 2026-11-04). Section 248 (introduced during parliamentary passage as government amendment New Clause NC120) inserts Section 216A into the Online Safety Act 2023, closing the OSA gap for one-to-one AI chatbot interactions that did not previously qualify as user-to-user or search services.",
